<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.854 from 1.844 per dlr in.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.854 from 1.844 per dlr in.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.854 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.844 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 6	   November 5</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.854		  1.844</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $11.650 million	  $14.810 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
